    "description": "States that documents are stored byte for byte as imported."
  },
  "@mediaDocumentsFooter": {
    "description": "Why there is no size control for documents: measured on real files, lossless compression gains 3.7-7.1% on PDFs and DOCX, and lossy compression destroys small text in a scan."
  },
  "@settingsMediaNote": {
    "description": "Subtitle for the Photos, video and sound row. Names the two things on that screen: how much a file is compressed, and transcription."
